--- nil vs the falsy values ---
nil is: nil
nil == nil     true
nil == false   false
nil == 0       false
nil == empty   false
--- declaring an optional ---
maybe-name: nil
real-name:  Alice
--- the forced unwrap ---
real-name has 5 characters
maybe-name is nil
--- functions that may return nothing ---
val1: has value
val2: nil
--- absence is asked with get, not by indexing ---
Host:    localhost
Timeout: 5000
--- the guard-and-return ---
HELLO!
(nothing to say)
--- nil propagation ---
chain 20:  50
chain 100: nil
chain nil: nil
--- nil in collections ---
with nils: [1 nil 3 nil 5]
without:   [1 3 5]
head of []:       nil
head of [1 2 3]:  1
--- nil in patterns ---
nothing
zero
something
--- a mutable optional ---
empty?   true
filled:  cached-data
cleared? true
